invariant: INV-16
file: srv_flight.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul
reason: the server derives its x25519 share under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED
  whatever it answered. The share is the same.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h counts the server's calls around its
  own and requires a server that answers CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME to call
  no file under its own names.

--- old
    widemul_x25519_base(widemul_answer(&h->t->cfg), h->pub, h->priv);
--- new
    widemul_x25519_base(CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, h->pub, h->priv);
